### Create branch (needs REST Client extension in VS Code)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/branches
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Computer Science", "code": "CSE" }

### List branches
GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches

### Signup
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fullName": "Test User", "email": "test@mail.com", "password": "123456", "branchId": 1 }

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "test@mail.com", "password": "123456" }
